{"id": "graham", "titulo": "Billy Graham · Preacher to the world", "inicio": "g1", "revelar": true, "escenas": [{"id": "g1", "titulo": "Charlotte, 1934", "fondo": "img/fondos/graham/granja.webp", "colorFondo": "#20160c", "elementos": [{"id": "e001", "tipo": "imagen", "src": "img/personajes/billy_joven/billy_joven.webp", "personaje": true, "nombre": "Billy", "x": 479, "y": 305, "w": 442, "h": 670, "rot": 0, "espejo": false}], "guion": [{"id": "l002", "tipo": "linea", "texto": "United States. Billy Graham was born in 1918 on a dairy farm near the city of Charlotte, North Carolina.", "forma": "caja", "expresion": "", "quien": ""}, {"id": "l003", "tipo": "linea", "texto": "In 1934, when Billy was 16, a preacher named Mordecai Ham came to Charlotte to hold meetings.", "forma": "caja", "expresion": "", "quien": ""}, {"id": "l004", "tipo": "linea", "texto": "What if I go and hear that preacher?", "forma": "pensamiento", "expresion": "", "quien": "e001"}, {"id": "c009", "tipo": "eleccion", "pregunta": "What does Billy do?", "opciones": [{"id": "o006", "texto": "Stay on the farm", "lineas": [{"id": "l005", "tipo": "linea", "texto": "He could have stayed… but he decided to go.", "forma": "caja", "expresion": "", "quien": ""}], "destino": "repetir"}, {"id": "o008", "texto": "Go and hear the preacher", "lineas": [{"id": "l007", "tipo": "linea", "texto": "I’ll go!", "forma": "globo", "expresion": "", "quien": "e001"}], "destino": "seguir"}]}], "salida": {"modo": "una", "pregunta": "", "opciones": [{"texto": "", "destino": "g2"}, {"texto": "", "destino": null}]}, "mapa": {"x": 0, "y": 0}}, {"id": "g2", "titulo": "The meeting", "fondo": "img/fondos/graham/carpa_1934.webp", "colorFondo": "#20160c", "elementos": [{"id": "e010", "tipo": "imagen", "src": "img/personajes/billy_joven/billy_joven_conmovido.webp", "personaje": true, "nombre": "Billy", "x": 583, "y": 305, "w": 434, "h": 670, "rot": 0, "espejo": false}], "guion": [{"id": "l011", "tipo": "linea", "texto": "At those meetings, Billy heard that Jesus died for him and that he could receive God’s forgiveness.", "forma": "caja", "expresion": "", "quien": ""}, {"id": "l012", "tipo": "linea", "texto": "Lord, I want to follow you.", "forma": "globo", "expresion": "", "quien": "e010"}, {"id": "l013", "tipo": "linea", "texto": "He later told how there, at 16, he gave his life to Christ.", "forma": "caja", "expresion": "", "quien": ""}, {"id": "l014", "tipo": "linea", "texto": "“For God so loved the world that He gave His one and only Son, that everyone who believes in Him shall not perish but have eternal life.” (John 3:16 · BSB)", "forma": "caja", "expresion": "", "quien": ""}], "salida": {"modo": "una", "pregunta": "", "opciones": [{"texto": "", "destino": "g3"}, {"texto": "", "destino": null}]}, "mapa": {"x": 0, "y": 0}}, {"id": "g3", "titulo": "Wheaton, 1943", "fondo": "img/fondos/graham/wheaton.webp", "colorFondo": "#20160c", "elementos": [{"id": "e015", "tipo": "imagen", "src": "img/personajes/billy/billy.webp", "personaje": true, "nombre": "Billy", "x": 308, "y": 275, "w": 424, "h": 700, "rot": 0, "espejo": false}, {"id": "e016", "tipo": "imagen", "src": "img/personajes/ruth/ruth.webp", "personaje": true, "nombre": "Ruth", "x": 864, "y": 325, "w": 431, "h": 650, "rot": 0, "espejo": false}], "guion": [{"id": "l017", "tipo": "linea", "texto": "Billy studied the Bible in Florida from 1937, and in 1939 he was ordained a pastor. Then he studied at Wheaton College, near Chicago, and graduated in 1943.", "forma": "caja", "expresion": "", "quien": ""}, {"id": "l018", "tipo": "linea", "texto": "There he met Ruth Bell, who had been born in China to missionary parents. They married in 1943.", "forma": "caja", "expresion": "", "quien": ""}, {"id": "l019", "tipo": "linea", "texto": "I grew up in China. My parents went there to bring the gospel.", "forma": "globo", "expresion": "", "quien": "e016"}, {"id": "l020", "tipo": "linea", "texto": "And I want to bring it to everyone who will listen.", "forma": "globo", "expresion": "", "quien": "e015"}], "salida": {"modo": "una", "pregunta": "", "opciones": [{"texto": "", "destino": "g4"}, {"texto": "", "destino": null}]}, "mapa": {"x": 0, "y": 0}}, {"id": "g4", "titulo": "Modesto, 1948", "fondo": "img/fondos/graham/hotel_modesto.webp", "colorFondo": "#20160c", "elementos": [{"id": "e021", "tipo": "imagen", "src": "img/personajes/billy/billy_pensativo.webp", "personaje": true, "nombre": "Billy", "x": 570, "y": 275, "w": 379, "h": 700, "rot": 0, "espejo": false}], "guion": [{"id": "l022", "tipo": "linea", "texto": "In 1948, in a hotel in Modesto, California, Billy and his team wrote down some rules for their work.", "forma": "caja", "expresion": "", "quien": ""}, {"id": "c027", "tipo": "eleccion", "pregunta": "What did they decide?", "opciones": [{"id": "o024", "texto": "Ask for lots of money at every meeting", "lineas": [{"id": "l023", "tipo": "linea", "texto": "No: they decided to be very careful and honest with money.", "forma": "caja", "expresion": "", "quien": ""}], "destino": "repetir"}, {"id": "o026", "texto": "Be honest in everything", "lineas": [{"id": "l025", "tipo": "linea", "texto": "They decided to be honest with money, to guard their conduct and their marriages, not to criticize other churches, and not to exaggerate how many people came.", "forma": "caja", "expresion": "", "quien": ""}], "destino": "seguir"}]}, {"id": "l028", "tipo": "linea", "texto": "Let nothing keep people from believing in Jesus.", "forma": "globo", "expresion": "", "quien": "e021"}], "salida": {"modo": "una", "pregunta": "", "opciones": [{"texto": "", "destino": "g5"}, {"texto": "", "destino": null}]}, "mapa": {"x": 0, "y": 0}}, {"id": "g5", "titulo": "Los Angeles, 1949", "fondo": "img/fondos/graham/carpa_los_angeles.webp", "colorFondo": "#20160c", "elementos": [{"id": "e029", "tipo": "imagen", "src": "img/personajes/billy/billy_predicando.webp", "personaje": true, "nombre": "Billy", "x": 479, "y": 275, "w": 442, "h": 700, "rot": 0, "espejo": false}], "guion": [{"id": "l030", "tipo": "linea", "texto": "In 1949 Billy preached in Los Angeles, in a huge circus tent set up in a parking lot.", "forma": "caja", "expresion": "", "quien": ""}, {"id": "l031", "tipo": "linea", "texto": "The meetings were planned for three weeks, but so many people came that they lasted eight.", "forma": "caja", "expresion": "", "quien": ""}, {"id": "l032", "tipo": "linea", "texto": "God loves you! Come to Jesus!", "forma": "globo", "expresion": "", "quien": "e029"}], "salida": {"modo": "una", "pregunta": "", "opciones": [{"texto": "", "destino": "g6"}, {"texto": "", "destino": null}]}, "mapa": {"x": 0, "y": 0}}, {"id": "g6", "titulo": "No more ropes, 1953", "fondo": "img/fondos/graham/auditorio_1953.webp", "colorFondo": "#20160c", "elementos": [{"id": "e033", "tipo": "imagen", "src": "img/personajes/billy/billy_decidido.webp", "personaje": true, "nombre": "Billy", "x": 524, "y": 275, "w": 473, "h": 700, "rot": 0, "espejo": false}], "guion": [{"id": "l034", "tipo": "linea", "texto": "In those years, parts of the United States had laws that separated people by the color of their skin. At some meetings, ropes kept white and Black people sitting apart.", "forma": "caja", "expresion": "", "quien": ""}, {"id": "l035", "tipo": "linea", "texto": "In 1953, at a meeting in Chattanooga, Billy saw the ropes.", "forma": "caja", "expresion": "", "quien": ""}, {"id": "c041", "tipo": "eleccion", "pregunta": "What does Billy do?", "opciones": [{"id": "o037", "texto": "Leave them where they are", "lineas": [{"id": "l036", "tipo": "linea", "texto": "Billy knew that before God we are all equal.", "forma": "caja", "expresion": "", "quien": ""}], "destino": "repetir"}, {"id": "o040", "texto": "Take down the ropes", "lineas": [{"id": "l038", "tipo": "linea", "texto": "Billy tore down the ropes himself.", "forma": "caja", "expresion": "", "quien": ""}, {"id": "l039", "tipo": "linea", "texto": "Everyone is welcome here.", "forma": "globo", "expresion": "", "quien": "e033"}], "destino": "seguir"}]}, {"id": "l042", "tipo": "linea", "texto": "“There is neither Jew nor Greek, slave nor free, male nor female, for you are all one in Christ Jesus.” (Galatians 3:28 · BSB)", "forma": "caja", "expresion": "", "quien": ""}, {"id": "l043", "tipo": "linea", "texto": "In 1957 he invited Martin Luther King Jr. to speak at his meetings in New York.", "forma": "caja", "expresion": "", "quien": ""}], "salida": {"modo": "una", "pregunta": "", "opciones": [{"texto": "", "destino": "g7"}, {"texto": "", "destino": null}]}, "mapa": {"x": 0, "y": 0}}, {"id": "g7", "titulo": "New York, 1957", "fondo": "img/fondos/graham/madison_square.webp", "colorFondo": "#20160c", "elementos": [{"id": "e044", "tipo": "imagen", "src": "img/personajes/billy/billy_predicando.webp", "personaje": true, "nombre": "Billy", "x": 539, "y": 275, "w": 442, "h": 700, "rot": 0, "espejo": false}], "guion": [{"id": "l045", "tipo": "linea", "texto": "In 1957 Billy preached in New York for 16 weeks, at Madison Square Garden and other places.", "forma": "caja", "expresion": "", "quien": ""}, {"id": "l046", "tipo": "linea", "texto": "Since 1950, his radio program “The Hour of Decision” had carried the gospel into many homes.", "forma": "caja", "expresion": "", "quien": ""}, {"id": "l047", "tipo": "linea", "texto": "Over the years he met with twelve presidents of the United States in a row, from Harry Truman to Barack Obama.", "forma": "caja", "expresion": "", "quien": ""}, {"id": "l048", "tipo": "linea", "texto": "No matter who you are: God loves you and wants to forgive you.", "forma": "globo", "expresion": "", "quien": "e044"}], "salida": {"modo": "una", "pregunta": "", "opciones": [{"texto": "", "destino": "g8"}, {"texto": "", "destino": null}]}, "mapa": {"x": 0, "y": 0}}, {"id": "g8", "titulo": "Montreat", "fondo": "img/fondos/graham/montreat.webp", "colorFondo": "#20160c", "elementos": [{"id": "e049", "tipo": "imagen", "src": "img/personajes/billy_mayor/billy_mayor.webp", "personaje": true, "nombre": "Billy", "x": 557, "y": 375, "w": 406, "h": 600, "rot": 0, "espejo": false}], "guion": [{"id": "l050", "tipo": "linea", "texto": "Ruth died in 2007. Billy spent his last years at his home in Montreat, in the mountains of North Carolina.", "forma": "caja", "expresion": "", "quien": ""}, {"id": "l051", "tipo": "linea", "texto": "According to his association, he preached in person to more than 210 million people in more than 185 countries.", "forma": "caja", "expresion": "", "quien": ""}, {"id": "l052", "tipo": "linea", "texto": "He died on February 21, 2018, at the age of 99. He was honored with a memorial in the United States Capitol.", "forma": "caja", "expresion": "", "quien": ""}, {"id": "l053", "tipo": "linea", "texto": "The message is still the same: God loves you.", "forma": "globo", "expresion": "", "quien": "e049"}], "salida": {"modo": "fin", "pregunta": "", "opciones": [{"texto": "", "destino": null}, {"texto": "", "destino": null}]}, "mapa": {"x": 0, "y": 0}}]}